title: Tutorials
description: Step-by-step SEGUL workflows on real datasets.
sidebar:
  order: 0
  label: Overview
---

Tutorials walk through a full workflow on a published dataset, from download to final output. Each one lists what you need, the data, and the numbers to expect, so you can check your results as you go.

For the options of a single tool, see the [GUI](/docs/gui-usage/intro/) and [CLI](/docs/cli-usage/intro/) guides instead.

## On a phone

Workflows in SEGUI on Android or iOS, with no computer needed.

